      "type": "caption",
      "provider_label": "caption",
      "text": "Figure 3: Distribution of conversion times for all documents, ordered by number of pages in a document, on all system configurations. Every dot represents one document. Log/log scale is used to even the spacing, since both number of pages and conversion times have long-tail distributions.",
